          "special": {
            "value": "You can't select another dedication feat until you have gained two other feats from the provocator archetype.\nLeads to: Cartwheel Dodge|AoE3, Flourishing Finish|AoE3, Murderer's Circle|AoE3, Performance Weapon Expert|AoE3, Pin To the Spot|AoE3"
